{"id":"indio","lemma":"indio","pos":"adj","rank":1377,"glosses":["Indian (from India)","Indian, Native American"],"ipa":"/ˈindjo/","forms":{"feminine":"india","masculinePlural":"indios","femininePlural":"indias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Millars-indio.wav","formAudio":{"india":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-India.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Te gusta la comida india?","en":"Do you like Indian food?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"food"},null]},{"text":"Le dejaron el fuerte a los indios.","en":"They abandoned the fort to the Indians.","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"strong"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Los indios dieron comida a los colonizadores.","en":"The Indians gave the settlers food.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/932151","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"food"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"colonizing","l":"colonizador"}]},{"text":"Al principio, los indios eran amables.","en":"At first, the Indians were friendly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687899","words":[null,null,{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"kind","l":"amable"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"at first, initially"]]},{"text":"Él ha estado en la India.","en":"He has been to India.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636532","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"country, land"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}